Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["LicDongleLibraryPath", "ObjectName", 
      CellID -> 1898991932], Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"LicDongleLibraryPath", "[", "]"}]], 
         "InlineFormula"], " \[LineSeparator]gives the native library in use, \
or the one the next call would load.\n", Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"LicDongleLibraryPath", "[", StyleBox["path", 
             "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], " \[LineSeparator]names the \
native library to load; call it before the first call."}], "Usage", 
      CellID -> 145490257], Cell["The native library keynub_licdongle_flat is \
part of the KeyNub SDK, not of the paclet.", "Notes", CellID -> 820278201], 
     Cell["Without LicDongleLibraryPath[path], the library is taken from the \
environment variable KEYNUB_LICDONGLE_FLAT_LIBRARY, from natives/<platform> \
in a clone of the SDK repository (searched from the working directory \
upwards), or by its bare name through the operating system's library search."\
, "Notes", CellID -> 703406605], Cell["A kernel loads the library once. \
LicDongleLibraryPath[path] after the first call gives \
Failure[\"LicDongleLibrary\", ...].", "Notes", CellID -> 1592398491]}, 
